1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,400
NASA satellites have tracked fires for 25 years.
But in 2012, the record jumps.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,900
The fires didn't change.
The satellite did.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:14,400
We tested how the two sensors relate,
on years our model never saw. Error fell from 77% to 14%.

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,400
Now it's one record, 2000 to today.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:24,400
Draw any area: Zij tells you
if this fire season is normal.

6
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:29,300
Built on NASA FIRMS,
for the teams who fight fires. Zij.
